THIRD-PARTY CODE

LokoOS depends on the following crates, each under its own licence. Run
`cargo tree` for the current set and `cargo license` for their terms.

    bitflags, spin, x86_64, uart_16550, linked_list_allocator, uefi, log

LokoOS contains no code, assets, icons, fonts or branding taken from any other
operating system. Compatibility runtimes for Windows and macOS applications are
downloaded and installed separately, never vendored into this repository; see
documentation/architecture/compatibility.md.
